<title>GERMANY: Buba revises down German Aug industry output. [CORRECTED 10:52 GMT]</title>
<headline>Buba revises down German Aug industry output. [CORRECTED 10:52 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the</p>
<p>following revised index figures for German industry output:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT	 Aug 96	 July 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 unch (+0.8)    +0.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +1.3 (+1.8)    -0.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    99.3 (100.3)   99.3</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -0.8 (+0.3)    +1.3</p>
<p>(Corrects August monthly percentage change from +0.8)</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +1.1 (+2.1)    -0.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    95.5 (96.8)    96.3</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +6.1 (+5.1)    -5.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +1.1 (unch)    +3.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   146.5 (145.1)  138.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
